    {
      "source": "Query object representing <a href=\"CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a>s, <a href=\"Columns.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a>\nand <a href=\"../cql/QueryOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>QueryOptions</code></a> for a CQL query. <a href=\"Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> is created with a fluent API creating immutable objects.",
      "translation": "表示用于 CQL 查询的<a href=\"CriteriaDefinition.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>CriteriaDefinition</code></a>、<a href=\"Columns.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Columns</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/ByteBuffer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio\"><code>paging state</code></a>以及<a href=\"../cql/QueryOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>QueryOptions</code></a>的对象。通过流式 API 创建不可变对象的<code>Query</code>类由此生成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"Query.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Query</code></a> initialized with a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/PageRequest.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageRequest</code></a> to fetch the first page of results or advance in\npaging along with sorting. Reads (and overrides, if set) <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Pageable.html#getPageSize()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>page size</code></a> into\n<code>QueryOptions#getPageSize()</code> and sets <code>pagingState</code> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>.",
